@startuml
title Вариант 2 — основной сценарий: durable workflow и push ACK
autonumber
hide footbox
participant "API / Relay" as A
database "Delivery Ledger" as D
queue "Kafka critical" as K
participant "Bridge" as B
participant "Temporal Service" as T
participant "Workflow worker" as F
participant "Activity worker" as W
participant "APNs/FCM" as P
participant "Клиент / Gateway" as G
A -> D: TX: notification + outbox; commit
note over A,D: API возвращает 202 только после commit (t0).
A -> K: NotificationAccepted
K -> B: событие
B -> T: StartWorkflow(id=notification_id, reject duplicate)
T --> B: start надёжно сохранён / already started
B -> D: сохранить маркер старта
B -> K: commit consumer offset
T -> F: workflow task
F -> T: schedule push activity + timer(t0+3s)
T -> W: activity task
W -> D: gate: confirmed/closed/TTL/допуски;\nstable attempt_id, CAS + lease
W -> P: push(notification_id)
P --> W: accepted
W -> D: сохранить результат
W -> T: activity completed
P -> G: push доставлен; клиент посылает ACK
G -> D: TX: receipt + confirmed gate + outbox
A -> K: ReceiptConfirmed
K -> B: receipt event
B -> T: Signal(notification_id, receipt_id)
T -> F: signal из durable history
F -> T: отменить timer; schedule final projection
T -> W: projection activity
W -> D: TX: read model + компактный итог
W -> T: ActivityCompleted
T -> F: результат финальной activity
F -> T: CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED)
note over T,D: Источник состояния оркестрации — history,
note over T,D: Ledger — источник приёма, receipts и внешних попыток.
@enduml
